  "title": "Trump’s Flight Swap and FAA Ground Stop Consequences",
  "summary": "Ex-FBI official reports that Trump confirmed a plane swap after a NATO summit in Turkey, deceiving the press and White House staff who flew without him. This led to the evacuation of the president via a catering truck, with the plane sent into the skies again in response to an Iranian assassination threat. A similar incident involving a plane swap caused the FAA to issue a nationwide ground stop due to communication issues. The FAA emphasized the system's antiquated equipment and safety concerns.",
  "facts": [
